  2 B-FLUSH-LINES        (P9)
  2 B-FLUSH-DAYS         (A3/1:31)
  2 B-FLUSH-WEEK-DAYS    (A2/1:7)
  2 B-FLUSH-CALENDAR     (A8)
  2 B-FLUSH-BEFORE-AFTER (A1)
